#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:2
msgid "Markdown for AI agents"
msgstr "面向 AI 智能体的 Markdown"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs serves a Markdown version of documentation pages to clients "
"that request it, using HTTP content negotiation. Markdown is smaller and "
"easier to parse than rendered HTML, which makes it a better format for AI "
"agents and language models to consume."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 通过 HTTP 内容协商，向请求 Markdown 的客户端提供文档页面的 Markdown 版本。Markdown "
"比渲染后的 HTML 更小、更易解析，因此更适合 AI 智能体和语言模型消费。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:9
msgid ""
"This feature is **enabled automatically** on all documentation domains "
"hosted on Read the Docs, with no configuration required. Browsers continue "
"to receive the regular HTML version of your documentation."
msgstr "此功能在 Read the Docs 托管的所有文档域名上**自动启用** ，无需任何配置。浏览器仍会收到常规的 HTML 版本文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:13
msgid "A request with ``Accept: text/markdown`` returns a Markdown response:"
msgstr "带 ``Accept: text/markdown`` 的请求会返回 Markdown 响应："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:31
msgid ""
"This feature is powered by `Cloudflare`_. See the `Cloudflare blog post on "
"Markdown for agents`_ for more details about how the conversion works."
msgstr ""
"此功能由 `Cloudflare`_ 提供支持。有关转换原理的更多细节，请参阅 `Cloudflare blog post on Markdown "
"for agents`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:36
msgid ":doc:`/reference/llms-txt`"
msgstr ":doc:`/reference/llms-txt`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:37
msgid ""
"Serve a custom ``llms.txt`` file to guide AI agents to the most relevant "
"pages of your documentation."
msgstr "提供自定义 ``llms.txt`` 文件，引导 AI 智能体访问你文档中最相关的页面。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:39
msgid ":doc:`/reference/agent-skills`"
msgstr ":doc:`/reference/agent-skills`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:40
msgid ""
"Use Read the Docs Agent Skills to help AI agents work with Read the Docs "
"APIs and configuration."
msgstr "使用 Read the Docs Agent Skills 帮助 AI 智能体使用 Read the Docs API 和配置。"

